   {
    "type": "column",
    "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong",
    "items": [
     {
      "type": "mainHeadline",
      "text": "A Perfect Day in Hongkong",
      "variant": "HEADING_XL",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_title",
      "isBold": true
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>15. September 2026 | 3 min read | Katja Tucich</b>",
      "size": "SMALL",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_info"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Purser Katja Tucich war schon viele Male in ihrer Lieblingsstadt Hongkong. Ihre Tipps für die Metropole, vom besten Kaffee bis zu ihrer Lieblingsbar.</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_description_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_separator"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Vormittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_0"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par0/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_noc-cafe_breakfast_c_jeremy-cheung_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": " Blätterteiggebäck mit Blaubeeren auf einem weißen Teller und ein Eiskaffee"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Kaffee bei NOC Coffee</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_1"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Mein Tag beginnt mit einem Kaffee bei NOC Coffee in der Whampoa Street</li><li>Von dort genieße ich den Blick auf die beeindruckende Skyline von Hongkong</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_2"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "NOC Coffee, Shop G42, G/F, Whampoa Garden Site 9 Block 1, Tak Fung St, Hung Hom",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_3"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par3/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_island_getty505252214_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Hung-Hom-Uferpromenade in Hongkong mit Skyline und Bergen im Hintergrund"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Spaziergang entlang der Promenade</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_4"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Mit einem Kaffee in der Hand schlendere ich an der Hung Hom Promenade entlang bis zur Avenue of Stars</li><li>Dort erinnern Handabdrücke von Filmlegenden wie Jackie Chan und Wong Kar-wai an die Geschichte des Hongkong-Kinos</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_5"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Avenue of Stars, Tsim Sha Tsui",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_6"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Mittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_7"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Shopping in der Mody Road</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_8"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>In der Mody Road stöbere ich gerne durch kleine Geschäfte und Straßenstände</li><li>Hier findet man Souvenirs, Reparaturservices und tolle Schnäppchen</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_9"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Mody Road, Tsim Sha Tsui",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_10"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Wong Tai Sin Temple</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_11"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par11/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_wong-tai-sim-temple_getty1751455646_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Wong-Tai-Sin-Tempel in Hongkong mit traditionellen Dächern und Skyline"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Der farbenprächtige Wong Tai Sin Temple gehört für mich zu jedem Hongkong-Besuch</li><li>Besonders spannend ist es, mehr über die Traditionen und die Geschichten hinter den Wahrsagungen zu erfahren</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_12"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Wong Tai Sin Temple, Chuk Un",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_13"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par13/separator_copy_copy_"
     },
