     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par13/separator_copy_copy__2109892519"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Nachmittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_14"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Streetfood am Temple Street Night Market</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_15"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Am Temple Street Night Market probiere ich gerne lokale Spezialitäten</li><li>Bei Temple Spice Crabs gibt es eine große Auswahl an Meeresfrüchten – mein Favorit ist allerdings Hühnchen süßsauer</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_16"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Temple Street Night Market, Temple Street, Jordan",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_17"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Pause im Kowloon Park</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_18"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Zwischen den vielen Eindrücken gönne ich mir gerne eine Auszeit im Kowloon Park</li><li>Das viele Grün und die Vogelgeräusche lassen einen fast vergessen, dass man mitten in der Stadt ist</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_19"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Kowloon Park, 22 Austin Road, Tsim Sha Tsui",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_20"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Abend</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_21"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par21/image_1118978923",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_bann-thai_c_jeremy-cheung_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Gemütliche Sitzecke mit Kissen und warmem Licht im Restaurant Baan Thai"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Dinner im Baan Thai</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_22"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Die thailändische Küche im Baan Thai gehört zu meinen kulinarischen Highlights in Hongkong</li><li>Mein Tipp: unbedingt vorab reservieren</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_23"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Baan Thai, 57 Wyndham Street, Central",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_24"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par24/image",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/de/article-images/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong/lh_app_hongkong_skyline_getty1297741599_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Beleuchtete Skyline von Hongkong bei Nacht mit Lichtstrahlen über dem Hafen"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>A Symphony of Lights</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_25"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Jeden Abend um 20 Uhr verwandelt die Licht- und Lasershow „A Symphony of Lights“ den Victoria Harbour in ein spektakuläres Farbenspiel</li><li>Die Show dauert nur wenige Minuten, bleibt aber lange in Erinnerung</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_26"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "A Symphony of Lights, Victoria Harbour",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_27"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Livemusik im The Iron Fairies</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_28"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Den Abend lasse ich gerne bei Livemusik im The Iron Fairies in Central ausklingen</li><li>Die Bar ist der perfekte Ort, um Hongkongs Nachtleben zu erleben</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_29"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "The Iron Fairies, 1 Hollywood Rd, Central",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_30"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Bildrechte:&nbsp;Unsplash / Bady Abbas, Jeremy Cheung (2), Getty Images (3)",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_31"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Zur Person</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_32"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Katja Tucich arbeitet seit 1999 bei Lufthansa und ist großer Hongkong-Fan. Von Beginn an war die Metropole eines ihrer Lieblingsziele, auch privat mit ihrer Tochter reist sie gern dorthin.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/asia/a-perfect-day-in-hong-kong_paragraph_33"
     }
    ],
